{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10264","headline":"送萧颖士赴东府得草字 · 姚发","name":"送萧颖士赴东府得草字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天生良史笔，浪迹擅文藻。\n中夏授参谋，东夷愿闻道。\n行轩翫春日，饯席藉芳草。\n幸得师季良，欣留箧笥宝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚发","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}